y for T4 chow. B8 is isolated, no nearby tiles in my hand or likely from opponents (B7, B9 not in my hand, B9 discarded before).  \nT4 is relatively safe (3 left, not many calls from opponents likely).  \nKeeping B3 pair uses abundant tile (4 left).  \nThis gives clearest one-sided wait, increasing chances to win, even if hand value low \u2014 but maybe I can get extra points from Self-Drawn, or Last Tile, etc., later.  \n\n**Answer:** Play B8"}
